      <activity id="a34e2483-caa6-599c-bb00-0102769c753e" activityNameId="0414eee2-c9f0-5007-9c40-8ba60c740175" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">156 kWp flat-roof installation, single-Si, on roof</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 156 kWp flat-roof installation, single-Si, on roof
Photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 156kWp and a life time of 30 years installed in Switzerland. The efficiency of single-Si PV modules is 17.9% (Fraunhofer ISE Photovoltaics Report 2019). The share of rejected or replaced PV modules is estimated at 3%. The inverter is assumed to be replaced once during the service life of the PV system.;
Synonyms: polycrystalline, multi-crystalline, silicon; 
UUID: 7c5bcdfa-391e-388b-a2ec-2d6191d08437
All components (modules, mounting system, electric installation, inverter) for the installation of a 156 kWp photovoltaic plant, energy use for the mounting, transport of materials to the place of installation. Disposal of components after end of life.
Location: Installation in CH
Technology: Current technology for mounting of panels or laminates, electric installations and other components.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire filled in by the operator of the plant (Edisun Power AG). 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7c5bcdfa-391e-388b-a2ec-2d6191d08437.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
